TuneBox @VERSION@ — Linux (x86_64)

Install:
    ./install.sh

Then start it from your app menu, or type: tunebox

Needs: a 64-bit Linux desktop with GTK3 and libmpv
    Ubuntu/Debian:  sudo apt install libmpv2      (or libmpv1 on older releases)
    Fedora:         sudo dnf install mpv-libs
    Arch:           sudo pacman -S mpv

Uninstall:
    ~/.local/share/tunebox/uninstall.sh
